      "writtenOn": "2024-04-24T18:05:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about using Zephyr\u0027s timer framework instead of a counter?\n\n```\n/* Add to init routine, expiration and stop callbacks not needed */\n\nk_timer_init(\u0026typec_timer, NULL, NULL);\n\n/*...*/\npdc_src_typec_only_run()\n{\ncase SRC_TYPEC_ATTACHED_SET_SINK_PATH_OFF:\n    /* Start one shot timer */\n    k_timer_start(\u0026typec_timer, K_MSEC(PD_T_SINK_WAIT_CAP), K_NO_WAIT);\n    \ncase SRC_TYPEC_ATTACHED_DEBOUNCE:\n    if (k_timer_status_get(\u0026typec_timer) \u003e 0)\n        set SRC_TYPEC_ATTACHED_RUN;\n}\n       \npdc_snk_typec_only_exit() \n{\n    k_timer_stop(\u0026typec_timer);\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 583,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 583,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "4fd96f461eaf06633dfac043a88af89bef254701",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ed9f2bb4_76c9f5ae",
