      "writtenOn": "2024-04-24T22:32:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have modified this to use the Zephyr timer framework as you suggested. One note is that I didn\u0027t put an explicit k_timer_stop call as the src.attached or snk.attached state transitions can happen from the send_cmd or send_cmd_wait states so there is not a single location where the timer can always be stopped. Letting the timer expire only has an effect if still in either the snk_typec_only or src_typec_only states.",
